<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>塔羅實作 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%AF%A6%E4%BD%9C/</link><description>Recent content in 塔羅實作 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%AF%A6%E4%BD%9C/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>三張牌牌陣教學：過去、現在、未來之外還能怎麼排？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E7%89%8C%E9%99%A3%E6%95%99%E5%AD%B8%E9%81%8E%E5%8E%BB%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%86%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E9%82%84%E8%83%BD%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E6%8E%92/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E7%89%8C%E9%99%A3%E6%95%99%E5%AD%B8%E9%81%8E%E5%8E%BB%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%86%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E9%82%84%E8%83%BD%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E6%8E%92/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;朋友說：「我明天要跟主管談加薪，幫我抽過去、現在、未來。」我會先停一下。過去發生過什麼，主管多半也知道；明天真正需要的是知道&lt;strong&gt;現況、卡點，以及談話策略&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>抽塔羅前怎麼問問題？從每日一張牌開始練習</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8A%BD%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%89%8D%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%95%8F%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E5%BE%9E%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E7%B7%B4%E7%BF%92/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8A%BD%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%89%8D%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%95%8F%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E5%BE%9E%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E7%B7%B4%E7%BF%92/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;手機放在桌上，訊息已讀了兩小時。你拿起牌，腦中只有一句：「他到底愛不愛我？」這個問題我懂，但抽完牌之後，你可能還是只能繼續盯著手機。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅逆位一定不好嗎？四種讀法與判斷順序</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E9%80%86%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%A5%BD%E5%97%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%A8%AE%E8%AE%80%E6%B3%95%E8%88%87%E5%88%A4%E6%96%B7%E9%A0%86%E5%BA%8F/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E9%80%86%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%A5%BD%E5%97%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%A8%AE%E8%AE%80%E6%B3%95%E8%88%87%E5%88%A4%E6%96%B7%E9%A0%86%E5%BA%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;太陽牌翻出來，本來應該鬆一口氣；偏偏它是倒著的。於是剛剛那口氣又吸回去：「太陽逆位，是不是連好牌都變壞了？」&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅解牌完整示範：面對兩個選擇，怎麼從牌走到行動？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%A4%BA%E7%AF%84%E9%9D%A2%E5%B0%8D%E5%85%A9%E5%80%8B%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%BE%9E%E7%89%8C%E8%B5%B0%E5%88%B0%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%A4%BA%E7%AF%84%E9%9D%A2%E5%B0%8D%E5%85%A9%E5%80%8B%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%BE%9E%E7%89%8C%E8%B5%B0%E5%88%B0%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;星期五下午，一封新公司的錄取通知寄來。你開心了五分鐘，接著開始算通勤、薪資、試用期，還有現在團隊那幾個真正合作得來的人。留下，還是走？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>